	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem a domino nostro etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Saepe deliberanti mihi, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quibus potissimum rationibus, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> dilecte pater, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tecum in gratiam redire possem,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName> spielt auf die gewährte Verlängerung seines Auslandstudiums trotz verschiedener Vergehen an; vgl. oben <ref target="file11496">Nr. 1453</ref>, 1-37.</note> omnes tamen cogitati<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ones meas et consilia tua superavit humanitas, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>benignitas et clementia, pro qua humanitate <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>gratias tibi, quantas possum, et ago et habeo vicissimque <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>polliceor me talem erga te futurum, qualem me <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>expectas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l284">Lypsiam</placeName>, quo proficisci iussi sumus, pro<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ficiscemur, ad proximas nundinas<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Gemeint ist die <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Frühjahrsmesse 1542, vgl. oben <ref target="file11607">Nr. 1564</ref>, 241.</note> alia vestra decreta <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>expectantes.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Rogamus tamen, dilecte pater, ut <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><persName ref="p3988">Wolphio</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p3988">Johannes Wolf</persName>.</note> et mihi <placeName ref="l284">Lypsiae</placeName> per integrum annum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>degere permittatis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8461">Wickius</persName> enim<pb type="edition" next="311"/> propter certas causas<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="4"><persName ref="p8461">Johann Jakob Wick</persName> hatte unerlaubt einem Mädchen die Ehe versprochen; s. oben <ref target="file11607">Nr. 1564</ref>, 2-18.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>a vobis vocatus ad proximas nundinas redire statuit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Nos, si permiseritis, post redibimus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed haec vobis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>decernenda, nobis exequenda erunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>De studiis meis hoc unum scribo, quod omnia eo <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>tendunt, ut functioni, ad quam destinatus sum, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>satisfacere possim.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Scio sanctum et divinum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>esse officium agoque gratias deo meo, quod humilitatem <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>servi sui (ut propheta inquit<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Lk 1, 48</ref></cit>.</note>) respexerit et <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>me vocarit ad sacrosanctum illud verbi sui mi<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>nisterium, lętorque in deo, servatore meo, quod is me <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>verbi nominisque sui praeconem esse voluerit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>haec alias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Cętera, quae nova sunt, alii<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Gemeint sind wohl <persName ref="p3988">Wolf</persName> und <persName ref="p8461">Wick</persName>; vgl. deren Briefe <ref target="file11607">Nr. 1564</ref> und 1568.</note> (ut opinor) <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>scribunt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Tu, quae antea commisi impru<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>dentius, ignosce, rogo; pia enim quędam simpli<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>citas, ut errarem (deum testor) causa fuit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Ignosce etiam, rogo, dilecte pater, quod ita raptim scribo; <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>brevi meliora dabo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum omni familia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Datum <placeName ref="l157">Francofurti</placeName>, 15. septembris 1541.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p8018">Ioan. Haller</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctissimo clarissimo<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>que viro d. M. <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l803">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>antistiti fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>domino ac patri suo per<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>petuo colendo.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
